<title>USA: First National Corp sets stock split.</title>
<headline>First National Corp sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>First National Corp said on Friday that it has declared a two-for-one stock split payable May 30, 1997 to shareholders of record as of May 19.</p>
<p>The company said it increased the number of authorized shares to 40 million from 20 million.</p>
